1
00:01:38,130 --> 00:01:43,060
[Shadow Punisher]

2
00:01:43,160 --> 00:01:43,720
[Divine Constable Tally]

3
00:01:43,720 --> 00:01:45,930
[Episode 18]

4
00:01:48,750 --> 00:01:51,500
[Chief Constable's Hall]

5
00:01:52,680 --> 00:01:53,509
Impossible.

6
00:01:54,310 --> 00:01:56,430
The young master couldn't have
killed himself.

7
00:01:56,430 --> 00:01:57,789
That's a fake suicide note.

8
00:01:57,789 --> 00:01:58,509
It's fake!

9
00:01:58,509 --> 00:01:59,229
Hold still!

10
00:02:00,920 --> 00:02:03,050
You said Tang Wei didn't kill himself.

11
00:02:03,310 --> 00:02:04,560
Is there any proof?

12
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:05,840
Footprints.

13
00:02:06,070 --> 00:02:07,280
There were footprints
behind the young master.

14
00:02:07,280 --> 00:02:08,210
I'm telling you,

15
00:02:08,310 --> 00:02:10,240
those footprints were forged.

16
00:02:11,520 --> 00:02:13,450
If the young master
had meant to kill himself,

17
00:02:13,450 --> 00:02:15,510
why would he have forged footprints?

18
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:17,079
Suppose he didn't want to live anymore,

19
00:02:17,079 --> 00:02:19,340
would he have any reason to frame anyone?

20
00:02:20,310 --> 00:02:23,079
What you said actually makes sense.

21
00:02:24,030 --> 00:02:25,560
There must be a hidden motive

22
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:27,030
behind Tang Wei's suicide.

23
00:02:27,030 --> 00:02:27,910
Nonsense!

24
00:02:28,680 --> 00:02:30,150
The young master was murdered.

25
00:02:30,150 --> 00:02:31,470
Someone took his life!

26
00:02:32,630 --> 00:02:33,430
Take him away.

27
00:02:33,560 --> 00:02:34,360
-Yes.
-Yes.

28
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:35,079
Move!

29
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:40,470
Given all that,

30
00:02:41,430 --> 00:02:43,630
let's not close the case as suicide yet.

31
00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:44,630
Got it.

32
00:03:03,030 --> 00:03:06,030
Give my life back to me.
Give my life back to me!

33
00:03:06,120 --> 00:03:07,590
Give my life back to me!

34
00:03:10,320 --> 00:03:11,680
It's just karmic infliction.

35
00:03:11,680 --> 00:03:13,080
It's all just karmic infliction.

36
00:03:13,080 --> 00:03:14,410
This is only a delusion.

37
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:16,380
Right.

38
00:03:17,570 --> 00:03:19,690
The world is filled with suffering.

39
00:03:20,310 --> 00:03:23,970
Take refuge in the Heavenly Lord,
and we shall be free from misery.

40
00:03:34,310 --> 00:03:36,510
Those two officials are fasting again?

41
00:03:37,680 --> 00:03:38,560
Chief,

42
00:03:39,870 --> 00:03:40,930
I've observed them

43
00:03:41,030 --> 00:03:43,030
carefully during their stay
at the Divine Constable Bureau

44
00:03:43,030 --> 00:03:44,520
these past few days.

45
00:03:44,910 --> 00:03:47,360
They are awakened by nightmares

46
00:03:47,710 --> 00:03:49,470
almost every night.

47
00:03:49,840 --> 00:03:50,840
Their health

48
00:03:51,520 --> 00:03:53,150
is deteriorating day by day.

49
00:03:55,470 --> 00:03:56,870
Since now we can't prove

50
00:03:56,870 --> 00:03:58,400
that Tang Wei was murdered,

51
00:03:58,960 --> 00:04:00,470
there's no need for Lord Huang

52
00:04:00,470 --> 00:04:02,600
and Lord Jiang to be detained anymore.

53
00:04:02,870 --> 00:04:04,120
So we're releasing them?

54
00:04:04,120 --> 00:04:04,960
What if...

55
00:04:05,080 --> 00:04:06,010
Just let them go.

56
00:04:07,960 --> 00:04:09,750
No, Chief.

57
00:04:09,770 --> 00:04:10,910
There isn't a word from His Majesty,

58
00:04:10,910 --> 00:04:12,700
nor a clear statement
from the Eastern Palace.

59
00:04:12,700 --> 00:04:14,660
Let's just pretend we don't know.

60
00:04:17,720 --> 00:04:19,180
-Wait, Chief...
-Mr. Yan.

61
00:04:21,430 --> 00:04:23,600
Chief told us to release them.

62
00:04:23,750 --> 00:04:26,080
But she didn't explicitly forbid us to...

63
00:04:27,040 --> 00:04:27,830
Tail them.

64
00:04:28,870 --> 00:04:30,200
I'll follow Huang Gang.

65
00:04:31,710 --> 00:04:33,510
[Mount Tianzhu]

66
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:39,800
Halt!

67
00:04:43,070 --> 00:04:44,680
Inquiries
from the Divine Constable Bureau.

68
00:04:44,680 --> 00:04:45,360
My Lord,

69
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:46,510
w-we are all law-abiding people.

70
00:04:46,510 --> 00:04:47,070
My Lord.

71
00:04:47,070 --> 00:04:50,630
-Yes, we are all law-abiding people.
-Don't worry. Just a few questions.

72
00:04:50,630 --> 00:04:51,390
Master Huang is said to have been

73
00:04:51,390 --> 00:04:53,630
seeking the way to immortality
on Mount Tianzhu in recent years.

74
00:04:53,630 --> 00:04:55,560
He has even moved
the Huang residence here.

75
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:56,360
Is it true?

76
00:04:56,360 --> 00:04:56,950
Yes.

77
00:04:56,950 --> 00:04:57,720
-Exactly.
-Master Huang

78
00:04:57,720 --> 00:04:59,240
has indeed achieved success
in cultivation.

79
00:04:59,240 --> 00:05:00,870
He doesn't care for women or money,

80
00:05:00,870 --> 00:05:02,630
but he craves tasty food—the only thing

81
00:05:02,630 --> 00:05:03,630
he can't forsake.

82
00:05:04,880 --> 00:05:05,800
In that case,

83
00:05:05,850 --> 00:05:07,240
why are you taking these groceries

84
00:05:07,240 --> 00:05:08,240
back home?

85
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:10,560
Are they not fresh?

86
00:05:10,830 --> 00:05:12,430
This time, after Master Huang
returned home—

87
00:05:12,430 --> 00:05:14,030
heaven knows what happened—

88
00:05:14,040 --> 00:05:15,830
he said he achieved success
in grain avoidance,

89
00:05:15,830 --> 00:05:17,830
and that he could ascend
to the immortal realm soon,

90
00:05:17,830 --> 00:05:18,680
hence no longer

91
00:05:18,680 --> 00:05:20,120
needing mortal food.

92
00:05:20,120 --> 00:05:20,390
Yes.

93
00:05:20,390 --> 00:05:21,270
Not only that.

94
00:05:21,430 --> 00:05:22,480
Master Huang's family,

95
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:23,680
which numbers over a dozen,

96
00:05:23,680 --> 00:05:24,870
wouldn't take a single bite of food.

97
00:05:24,870 --> 00:05:25,270
Who are we

98
00:05:25,270 --> 00:05:26,830
supposed to sell so many groceries to?

99
00:05:26,570 --> 00:05:31,200
[Huang Mansion]

100
00:05:33,970 --> 00:05:36,050
[Huang Mansion]

101
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:03,810
[Constable Ghost]

102
00:06:03,430 --> 00:06:04,310
Master Huang knew

103
00:06:04,310 --> 00:06:06,070
there would be a visitor
from the Divine Constable Bureau,

104
00:06:06,070 --> 00:06:07,600
so he instructed me beforehand

105
00:06:06,420 --> 00:06:08,680
[Constable Ghost]

106
00:06:07,750 --> 00:06:08,950
to answer any questions

107
00:06:08,950 --> 00:06:10,510
you might ask.

108
00:06:10,510 --> 00:06:12,190
Do you know every little thing

109
00:06:12,920 --> 00:06:13,950
about the Huang household?

110
00:06:13,950 --> 00:06:15,430
Please take a look, My Lord.

111
00:06:15,430 --> 00:06:17,430
All within this estate—
high and low, old and young—

112
00:06:17,430 --> 00:06:19,950
and Master Huang's chamber
for quiet cultivation

113
00:06:19,950 --> 00:06:21,160
are all laid bare to you.

114
00:06:21,160 --> 00:06:22,870
What secrets could there be?

115
00:06:24,510 --> 00:06:26,480
Here are some immortality pills
given by Mr. Tang Wei

116
00:06:26,480 --> 00:06:27,720
to Master Huang.

117
00:06:27,750 --> 00:06:29,560
According to Mr. Tang,
those who take these pills

118
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:32,159
can ascend to the immortal realm
in three days.

119
00:06:32,950 --> 00:06:33,880
Immortal pills?

120
00:06:34,270 --> 00:06:36,800
Why is something so important
to Master Huang

121
00:06:36,830 --> 00:06:38,190
in your hands now?

122
00:06:38,240 --> 00:06:39,630
Mr. Tang said that despite

123
00:06:39,630 --> 00:06:40,920
the benefits of the immortality pills,

124
00:06:40,920 --> 00:06:42,380
they would be no different

125
00:06:42,390 --> 00:06:43,159
from ordinary rice

126
00:06:43,159 --> 00:06:45,490
and flour for those without cultivation.

127
00:06:45,720 --> 00:06:47,040
Now, it has been two days since all

128
00:06:47,040 --> 00:06:48,750
in the Huang household
took the immortality pills.

129
00:06:48,750 --> 00:06:50,720
Tomorrow is the day of ascension.

130
00:06:51,120 --> 00:06:52,040
Master Huang ordered

131
00:06:52,040 --> 00:06:53,240
these extra pills to be

132
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:56,240
given to destined ones
since they're no longer of use.

133
00:07:10,270 --> 00:07:11,160
If so,

134
00:07:11,750 --> 00:07:13,680
tell Master Huang I said thank you.

135
00:07:15,750 --> 00:07:16,810
It's getting late.

136
00:07:16,920 --> 00:07:18,430
Why not spend the night here

137
00:07:18,430 --> 00:07:19,720
and watch Master Huang ascend

138
00:07:19,720 --> 00:07:21,520
to the immortal realm tomorrow?

139
00:07:21,630 --> 00:07:22,430
No need.

140
00:07:23,310 --> 00:07:24,430
I will spend the night

141
00:07:24,430 --> 00:07:25,510
on Mount Tianzhu.

142
00:07:26,070 --> 00:07:27,360
Should anything happen,

143
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:29,560
come find me at the foot of the mountain.

144
00:07:31,160 --> 00:07:34,890
[Tang Mansion]

145
00:07:35,240 --> 00:07:36,680
On the day of the incident,

146
00:07:36,680 --> 00:07:37,750
there were four cups and four sets

147
00:07:37,750 --> 00:07:39,120
of tableware on the table

148
00:07:39,120 --> 00:07:40,830
in the sixth-floor dining room.

149
00:07:40,830 --> 00:07:42,290
Even counting Tang Wei in,

150
00:07:42,290 --> 00:07:43,870
only three sets of tableware were needed.

151
00:07:43,870 --> 00:07:45,430
Who was the fourth one for?

152
00:07:46,830 --> 00:07:48,120
And what's the message hidden

153
00:07:48,120 --> 00:07:49,650
in Tang Wei's jade pendant?

154
00:07:50,370 --> 00:07:53,530
[Tang Mansion]

155
00:07:55,860 --> 00:07:57,920
[Tang Mansion]

156
00:07:59,120 --> 00:08:01,110
Who would go out at this hour of the day?

157
00:08:01,110 --> 00:08:02,300
It's late and dark.

158
00:08:02,340 --> 00:08:02,800
How come

159
00:08:02,800 --> 00:08:04,730
there isn't even a lantern bearer?

160
00:08:22,750 --> 00:08:23,600
Come on.

161
00:08:23,720 --> 00:08:24,510
Careful.

162
00:08:28,430 --> 00:08:30,890
It turns out they are dumping a body
at night.

163
00:08:39,390 --> 00:08:40,120
What is it?

164
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:40,549
Run!

165
00:08:40,549 --> 00:08:41,320
Let's go!

166
00:08:41,510 --> 00:08:43,240
Come back! Why are you running away?

167
00:08:43,240 --> 00:08:44,700
Let's get it done quickly.

168
00:09:04,510 --> 00:09:06,390
If I take the body away now,

169
00:09:06,670 --> 00:09:08,330
the culprit might be alerted.

170
00:09:14,150 --> 00:09:14,870
This seems

171
00:09:14,870 --> 00:09:17,000
like the attire of Miaoxu Sect.

172
00:09:17,240 --> 00:09:18,360
Disciples of this sect

173
00:09:18,360 --> 00:09:20,220
have come here for drinks before.

174
00:09:20,360 --> 00:09:21,720
Go and find out

175
00:09:22,150 --> 00:09:23,670
if any disciples of Miaoxu Sect

176
00:09:23,670 --> 00:09:25,130
have gone missing lately.

177
00:09:25,750 --> 00:09:26,550
Yes.

178
00:09:41,720 --> 00:09:43,380
This pill contains no poison,

179
00:09:44,480 --> 00:09:47,140
but it's definitely unrelated
to immortality.

180
00:10:10,360 --> 00:10:12,510
Don't be afraid, everyone.

181
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:13,910
Tomorrow, we will

182
00:10:13,910 --> 00:10:15,770
all ascend to the immortal realm.

183
00:10:15,840 --> 00:10:17,910
Then we will be free
from worldly attachments

184
00:10:17,910 --> 00:10:19,440
and demonic interference!

185
00:10:32,550 --> 00:10:34,480
Evil spirits and demons! There are

186
00:10:34,750 --> 00:10:36,150
evil spirits and demons!

187
00:10:37,480 --> 00:10:38,510
Immortality pills restore youth.

188
00:10:38,510 --> 00:10:39,720
Failing to gain immortality
brings disasters.

189
00:10:39,720 --> 00:10:40,910
The heavenly path opens
when merit is fulfilled.

190
00:10:40,910 --> 00:10:43,510
It is unknown to all
till one treads the clouds.

191
00:10:44,590 --> 00:10:47,180
[Taotie Terrace]

192
00:10:47,550 --> 00:10:48,360
Look!

193
00:10:48,840 --> 00:10:49,510
Yes.

194
00:10:49,510 --> 00:10:50,840
It's the reincarnation of Zhang Guolao.

195
00:10:50,840 --> 00:10:51,870
Master Huang is ascending to immortality!

196
00:10:51,870 --> 00:10:52,550
It's his ascension.

197
00:10:52,550 --> 00:10:53,870
-He's becoming an immortal.
-Immortal ascension!

198
00:10:53,870 --> 00:10:55,270
Master Huang is ascending to immortality.

199
00:10:55,270 --> 00:10:56,750
Congratulations to him!

200
00:10:58,240 --> 00:10:59,120
This is incredible.

201
00:10:59,120 --> 00:11:00,030
Look at that!

202
00:11:00,200 --> 00:11:01,630
It's an old immortal.

203
00:11:02,750 --> 00:11:05,080
Immortality pills restore youth.

204
00:11:05,150 --> 00:11:07,550
Failing to gain immortality
brings disasters.

205
00:11:07,550 --> 00:11:09,720
The heavenly path opens
when merit is fulfilled.

206
00:11:09,720 --> 00:11:12,440
It is unknown to all
till one treads the clouds!

207
00:11:15,720 --> 00:11:18,910
Master Huang is finally returning
to the immortal realm.

208
00:11:18,910 --> 00:11:20,080
A joyous occasion indeed.

209
00:11:20,080 --> 00:11:21,360
Congratulations to him.

210
00:11:21,360 --> 00:11:23,510
Master Huang is returning
to the immortal realm!

211
00:11:23,510 --> 00:11:25,200
How very wonderful!

212
00:11:25,510 --> 00:11:27,910
The heavenly path opens
when merit is fulfilled.

213
00:11:27,910 --> 00:11:30,510
It is unknown to all
till one treads the clouds.

214
00:11:30,510 --> 00:11:32,750
The heavenly path opens
when merit is fulfilled.

215
00:11:32,750 --> 00:11:35,240
It is unknown to all
till one treads the clouds.

216
00:11:35,240 --> 00:11:37,440
The heavenly path opens
when merit is fulfilled.

217
00:11:37,440 --> 00:11:39,030
It is unknown to all
till one treads the clouds.

218
00:11:39,030 --> 00:11:39,910
Don't!

219
00:11:42,240 --> 00:11:43,000
What just happened?

220
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:44,150
Why did they jump from here?

221
00:11:44,150 --> 00:11:45,080
Yes.

222
00:11:45,630 --> 00:11:46,440
Why did they jump?

223
00:11:46,440 --> 00:11:47,270
They jumped?

224
00:12:08,480 --> 00:12:09,240
Has Huang Gang

225
00:12:09,240 --> 00:12:11,040
truly ascended to immortality?

226
00:12:14,630 --> 00:12:15,630
Constable Ghost,

227
00:12:15,760 --> 00:12:17,080
we did our best to search and found

228
00:12:17,080 --> 00:12:18,510
the corpses below incomplete.

229
00:12:18,510 --> 00:12:19,270
The cliff is steep and high

230
00:12:19,270 --> 00:12:20,270
with the wind blowing hard.

231
00:12:20,270 --> 00:12:22,200
Shall we carry the remains up here?

232
00:12:22,720 --> 00:12:23,550
No need.

233
00:12:24,550 --> 00:12:25,510
Did you find Huang Gang?

234
00:12:25,510 --> 00:12:26,440
No, we didn't.

235
00:12:26,480 --> 00:12:27,880
We only found his donkey.

236
00:12:29,320 --> 00:12:31,050
You found Huang Gang's donkey?

237
00:12:31,960 --> 00:12:35,910
When one attains immortality,
even his fouls and hounds rise to heaven.

238
00:12:35,910 --> 00:12:37,320
But why did Huang's donkey stay

239
00:12:37,320 --> 00:12:38,670
while he disappeared?

240
00:12:39,120 --> 00:12:40,550
The only thing I'm certain of

241
00:12:40,550 --> 00:12:41,270
is that Huang Gang

242
00:12:41,270 --> 00:12:43,330
didn't ascend to the immortal realm.

243
00:12:44,080 --> 00:12:45,080
In my opinion,

244
00:12:45,480 --> 00:12:46,630
he possibly

245
00:12:47,150 --> 00:12:47,870
went with

246
00:12:47,870 --> 00:12:49,390
those fools in his family

247
00:12:49,450 --> 00:12:51,480
to meet their ancestors in heaven.

248
00:12:53,510 --> 00:12:54,910
As you said, Huang Gang might be

249
00:12:54,910 --> 00:12:55,870
old and foolish.

250
00:12:55,870 --> 00:12:57,800
But what were his family thinking?

251
00:12:58,270 --> 00:13:00,270
They actually jumped off the cliff.

252
00:13:01,270 --> 00:13:02,730
Any findings on your side?

253
00:13:03,080 --> 00:13:03,840
For the past few days,

254
00:13:03,840 --> 00:13:04,480
we've been examining

255
00:13:04,480 --> 00:13:06,740
the account records of Lanyue Pavilion.

256
00:13:07,270 --> 00:13:08,790
The fourth guest hadn't

257
00:13:09,120 --> 00:13:11,380
been to Lanyue Pavilion for three years.

258
00:13:11,550 --> 00:13:12,720
Do you know why?

259
00:13:13,270 --> 00:13:14,840
Because he already died

260
00:13:15,120 --> 00:13:16,720
three years ago.

261
00:13:17,080 --> 00:13:17,910
Who was he?

262
00:13:18,270 --> 00:13:20,150
Someone who would
hang out with Lord Huang,

263
00:13:20,150 --> 00:13:22,030
Lord Jiang, and Mr. Tang was

264
00:13:22,120 --> 00:13:23,670
certainly also an official.

265
00:13:23,670 --> 00:13:26,080
A high-ranking official died
three years ago.

266
00:13:26,080 --> 00:13:26,840
Who was he?

267
00:13:28,270 --> 00:13:30,270
Hu Hai, the former General Zhennan.

268
00:13:30,910 --> 00:13:32,000
Exactly.

269
00:13:32,270 --> 00:13:33,270
I'm telling you,

270
00:13:33,440 --> 00:13:34,910
Hu Hai also died

271
00:13:34,960 --> 00:13:36,160
in a mystical manner.

272
00:13:37,720 --> 00:13:40,320
He was slain by the blade
to attain liberation.

273
00:13:41,480 --> 00:13:43,030
I'll head to Hu Hai's abode right away.

274
00:13:43,030 --> 00:13:43,840
No need.

275
00:13:44,080 --> 00:13:44,750
I just came back

276
00:13:44,750 --> 00:13:46,240
from General Hu Hai's residence.

277
00:13:46,240 --> 00:13:47,360
I've also brought

278
00:13:47,360 --> 00:13:48,440
his butler here.

279
00:13:49,630 --> 00:13:50,670
My Lords,

280
00:13:49,810 --> 00:13:53,210
[Clear as a Mirror]

281
00:13:50,720 --> 00:13:51,910
after Master Hu resigned from office,

282
00:13:51,910 --> 00:13:53,720
he felt deeply guilty
for committing too many killings,

283
00:13:53,720 --> 00:13:56,520
so he started believing
in immortal cultivation.

284
00:13:56,750 --> 00:13:59,010
At that time, an immortal master told him

285
00:13:59,030 --> 00:14:00,720
that only through death by the blade

286
00:14:00,720 --> 00:14:03,720
to attain liberation
could he atone for his killings.

287
00:14:04,750 --> 00:14:05,960
That immortal master

288
00:14:06,840 --> 00:14:08,870
was Mr. Tang of Lanyue Pavilion, right?

289
00:14:08,870 --> 00:14:09,670
Correct.

290
00:14:10,720 --> 00:14:12,480
On the Mid-Autumn Festival
three years ago,

291
00:14:12,480 --> 00:14:13,960
our master threw himself

292
00:14:13,960 --> 00:14:15,750
into his own sword-forging furnace.

293
00:14:15,750 --> 00:14:17,270
When the fire went out,

294
00:14:17,270 --> 00:14:18,720
we opened the furnace,

295
00:14:18,840 --> 00:14:20,500
but there was nothing inside.

296
00:14:20,510 --> 00:14:21,630
Nothing inside?

297
00:14:21,960 --> 00:14:23,080
Even with blazing fires,

298
00:14:23,080 --> 00:14:24,910
there should have been ashes left.

299
00:14:24,910 --> 00:14:26,440
He couldn't have just vanished.

300
00:14:26,440 --> 00:14:28,510
So everyone in the mansion said

301
00:14:28,550 --> 00:14:30,750
that Master Hu must have succeeded
in the weapon liberation

302
00:14:30,750 --> 00:14:32,750
and ascended to the immortal realm.

303
00:14:33,390 --> 00:14:34,200
My Lords.

304
00:14:34,240 --> 00:14:35,720
[Clear as a Mirror]

305
00:14:35,150 --> 00:14:36,150
My Lords,

306
00:14:36,240 --> 00:14:37,750
we found a secret passage
in the sword-forging furnace

307
00:14:37,750 --> 00:14:38,880
of the Hu residence.

308
00:14:39,750 --> 00:14:41,550
Just now, when I opened
the sword-forging furnace

309
00:14:41,550 --> 00:14:42,630
in General Hu Hai's mansion,

310
00:14:42,630 --> 00:14:44,150
somehow there was a strange sound.

311
00:14:44,150 --> 00:14:45,240
So I asked Ding Mao and Jiang Zhan

312
00:14:45,240 --> 00:14:46,500
to check it carefully.

313
00:14:46,510 --> 00:14:47,870
It took us some time to finally

314
00:14:47,870 --> 00:14:49,960
catch a faint glimpse of a door inside.

315
00:14:49,960 --> 00:14:51,550
However, the passage behind it

316
00:14:51,550 --> 00:14:53,210
was already blocked by rocks.

317
00:14:53,510 --> 00:14:54,910
Where does this secret passage lead?

318
00:14:54,910 --> 00:14:56,000
It leads to the dense forest

319
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:56,960
outside the Hu residence.

320
00:14:56,960 --> 00:14:57,870
So, as expected,

321
00:14:57,870 --> 00:14:58,630
General Hu Hai

322
00:14:58,630 --> 00:15:00,320
didn't die from weapon liberation,

323
00:15:00,320 --> 00:15:01,440
but simply disappeared.

324
00:15:01,440 --> 00:15:03,030
He was probably taken away.

325
00:15:03,320 --> 00:15:04,240
After Master Hu died,

326
00:15:04,240 --> 00:15:05,080
that sword-forging furnace

327
00:15:05,080 --> 00:15:06,910
became a forbidden area
in the Hu residence.

328
00:15:06,910 --> 00:15:07,790
None of us

329
00:15:07,790 --> 00:15:09,360
have ever opened it again!

330
00:15:09,670 --> 00:15:10,550
Let me ask you.

331
00:15:11,030 --> 00:15:12,670
After General Hu's passing,

332
00:15:12,910 --> 00:15:14,200
his favorite granddaughter

333
00:15:14,200 --> 00:15:15,510
also passed away.

334
00:15:15,550 --> 00:15:16,720
Is it true?

335
00:15:17,080 --> 00:15:18,270
It is true.

336
00:15:18,510 --> 00:15:20,750
On the seventh day
after Master Hu's ascension,

337
00:15:20,750 --> 00:15:22,750
Her Ladyship suddenly had a dream,

338
00:15:22,840 --> 00:15:23,750
in which Master Hu told her

339
00:15:23,750 --> 00:15:25,870
that he had ascended to the heavenly realm

340
00:15:25,870 --> 00:15:27,270
where there was incomparable glory,

341
00:15:27,270 --> 00:15:29,130
and that he would bring her there.

342
00:15:29,670 --> 00:15:32,130
The next day,
when I checked on Her Ladyship,

343
00:15:32,150 --> 00:15:34,150
I found her sitting straight on the bed,

344
00:15:34,150 --> 00:15:37,000
already dead.

345
00:15:38,720 --> 00:15:39,630
My Lords!

346
00:15:42,760 --> 00:15:43,570
My Lords,

347
00:15:43,720 --> 00:15:45,030
after investigation,

348
00:15:45,240 --> 00:15:47,840
I can confirm
that Butler Hu is telling the truth.

349
00:15:47,840 --> 00:15:48,870
However, later on,

350
00:15:48,870 --> 00:15:50,630
as we questioned many servants,

351
00:15:50,630 --> 00:15:51,630
they all said

352
00:15:51,960 --> 00:15:53,550
that before Miss Hu was buried,

353
00:15:53,550 --> 00:15:54,360
her body

354
00:15:54,360 --> 00:15:56,080
radiated rainbow-like colors

355
00:15:56,080 --> 00:15:57,540
that lasted several days.

356
00:15:58,150 --> 00:15:59,320
I took the liberty

357
00:15:59,320 --> 00:16:00,790
to open Miss Hu's coffin.

358
00:16:01,150 --> 00:16:02,350
Here is a bone of hers.

359
00:16:03,770 --> 00:16:05,840
Her Ladyship was buried
and should rest in peace.

360
00:16:05,840 --> 00:16:07,030
H-How could you...

361
00:16:07,270 --> 00:16:08,080
Don't move!

362
00:16:08,710 --> 00:16:10,370
Her body showed seven colors.

363
00:16:11,360 --> 00:16:13,160
The Seven-Flower Bliss Powder.

364
00:16:13,870 --> 00:16:14,670
In recent years,

365
00:16:14,670 --> 00:16:16,360
since Sage Wuxin,
head of Miaoxu Sect, has been

366
00:16:16,360 --> 00:16:17,720
rectifying the sect's discipline,

367
00:16:17,720 --> 00:16:19,510
very few disciples would leave
the mountain,

368
00:16:19,510 --> 00:16:21,200
much less go missing.

369
00:16:24,320 --> 00:16:25,390
Look at the fabric.

370
00:16:25,960 --> 00:16:28,360
This garment was made years ago,
wasn't it?

371
00:16:36,360 --> 00:16:37,440
It is an old garment.

372
00:16:37,440 --> 00:16:38,910
Go talk lto Sage Wuxin again.

373
00:16:38,910 --> 00:16:39,870
Ask him

374
00:16:40,270 --> 00:16:42,770
for the list
of all missing female cultivators

375
00:16:42,770 --> 00:16:44,940
of Miaoxu Sect in the past 10 years.

376
00:16:46,270 --> 00:16:47,080
Yes.

377
00:16:51,340 --> 00:16:52,940
Master, where are you going?

378
00:16:54,360 --> 00:16:56,670
This whole thing has cost me
one day and one night.

379
00:16:56,670 --> 00:16:58,510
I have to go to Jiang Zeshui's place now,

380
00:16:58,510 --> 00:17:00,710
or I'm afraid something might go wrong.

381
00:17:09,510 --> 00:17:12,030
Jin Se, you may leave now.

382
00:17:45,880 --> 00:17:47,010
Why is my old illness

383
00:17:47,070 --> 00:17:49,070
acting up more and more frequently?

384
00:17:51,680 --> 00:17:52,480
That is to say,

385
00:17:52,480 --> 00:17:53,920
Hu Hai was taken away by someone,

386
00:17:53,920 --> 00:17:55,120
and so was Huang Gang.

387
00:17:56,960 --> 00:17:58,440
Now this is odd.

388
00:17:59,160 --> 00:18:00,420
Among the three guests

389
00:18:00,750 --> 00:18:02,830
on the sixth floor of Lanyue Pavilion,

390
00:18:02,830 --> 00:18:04,480
two went missing,

391
00:18:04,830 --> 00:18:05,760
and the other one

392
00:18:05,830 --> 00:18:07,350
died in a mystical manner.

393
00:18:08,310 --> 00:18:09,880
Given all that...

394
00:18:10,510 --> 00:18:11,270
This is bad.

395
00:18:12,550 --> 00:18:14,880
I'm afraid Jiang Zeshui is also in danger.

396
00:18:17,070 --> 00:18:19,660
A visit to the Jiang residence
seems like a must.

397
00:18:19,660 --> 00:18:21,230
Got it. I'll be on my way.

398
00:18:21,250 --> 00:18:21,960
Sure.

399
00:18:23,790 --> 00:18:25,910
[Jiang Mansion]

400
00:18:26,070 --> 00:18:27,590
-Lord Constable Iron.
-Lord Constable Iron.

401
00:18:27,590 --> 00:18:28,310
What have you found?

402
00:18:28,310 --> 00:18:29,270
Lord Constable Iron,

403
00:18:29,270 --> 00:18:30,830
Lord Jiang has been staying indoors

404
00:18:30,830 --> 00:18:31,960
these past few days.

405
00:18:32,150 --> 00:18:33,270
Those in the residence all say

406
00:18:33,270 --> 00:18:34,960
that he won't meet guests
as he is about to ascend

407
00:18:34,960 --> 00:18:35,890
to immortality.

408
00:18:36,450 --> 00:18:37,550
Over the past few days of standing

409
00:18:37,550 --> 00:18:39,000
guard here, we haven't seen any visitors.

410
00:18:39,000 --> 00:18:41,240
Farewell, Master!

411
00:18:41,350 --> 00:18:41,880
Quick!

412
00:18:41,600 --> 00:18:43,530
[Jiang Mansion]

413
00:18:41,880 --> 00:18:42,750
-Oh no.
-Quick!

414
00:18:43,570 --> 00:18:45,000
[Ascending to Immortality]

415
00:18:44,550 --> 00:18:49,480
Farewell, Master.
May we reach the Pure Land together.

416
00:18:49,570 --> 00:18:54,400
Farewell, Master.
May we reach the Pure Land together.

417
00:18:54,480 --> 00:18:57,200
-Hurry! Stop, all of you!
-Everyone, stop!

418
00:18:57,440 --> 00:18:58,440
Quick, stop them!

419
00:18:58,510 --> 00:18:59,880
Go help them out!

420
00:19:00,680 --> 00:19:01,270
Get back here!

421
00:19:01,270 --> 00:19:04,400
-A cultivator should have a peaceful mind.
-Who are you?

422
00:19:04,480 --> 00:19:07,550
Do not let worldly matters
burden your heart.

423
00:19:07,550 --> 00:19:08,000
Come up here!

424
00:19:08,000 --> 00:19:08,750
Lord Jiang?

425
00:19:08,750 --> 00:19:09,550
This is bad.

426
00:19:09,640 --> 00:19:10,270
Save these people!

427
00:19:10,270 --> 00:19:12,930
Casting aside worldly affairs
with both hands,

428
00:19:13,310 --> 00:19:17,310
I step onto the lotus
bringing me to the other shore.

429
00:19:18,110 --> 00:19:22,270
My feet feel light
as if I were treading the clouds.

430
00:19:22,440 --> 00:19:23,070
Lord Jiang!

431
00:19:23,070 --> 00:19:27,510
My body lies in the void
beyond the farthest heaven.

432
00:19:28,350 --> 00:19:30,240
How is he able to walk on water?

433
00:19:33,360 --> 00:19:34,220
This is urgent.

434
00:19:36,500 --> 00:19:38,160
Are you planning to swim over?

435
00:19:40,030 --> 00:19:41,960
How else am I supposed to get there?

436
00:19:42,070 --> 00:19:44,590
On foot, of course.

437
00:19:44,590 --> 00:19:45,310
On foot?

438
00:20:06,310 --> 00:20:07,110
Hidden posts?

439
00:20:08,110 --> 00:20:09,110
Now I understand.

440
00:20:09,680 --> 00:20:11,270
Immortal magic doesn't exist at all.

441
00:20:11,270 --> 00:20:13,510
There are just stepping posts
in the water.

442
00:20:13,510 --> 00:20:15,510
This is the path to immortality.
I am to become an immortal.

443
00:20:15,510 --> 00:20:18,510
-This is the path to immortality. I am...
-Lord Jiang.

444
00:20:23,920 --> 00:20:26,480
You foolish man
obsessed with the mundane world,

445
00:20:26,480 --> 00:20:28,210
repent and turn back already.

446
00:20:28,720 --> 00:20:29,590
Lord Jiang,

447
00:20:30,310 --> 00:20:31,610
you are the one who should turn back.

448
00:20:31,610 --> 00:20:33,750
I won't argue with you
about the credibility

449
00:20:33,750 --> 00:20:35,200
of cultivation for now.

450
00:20:35,240 --> 00:20:36,900
But if the immortals in heaven

451
00:20:36,960 --> 00:20:39,760
only know to play mysterious tricks
like this one,

452
00:20:40,070 --> 00:20:41,670
then I don't think you should

453
00:20:42,030 --> 00:20:43,290
continue on this path.

454
00:20:45,510 --> 00:20:48,100
In all my life, for saving countless lives
by harnessing rivers,

455
00:20:48,100 --> 00:20:49,580
I've earned merit.

456
00:20:49,960 --> 00:20:52,670
These immortal posts
were naturally formed.

457
00:20:52,720 --> 00:20:54,000
Together they pave a path

458
00:20:54,000 --> 00:20:56,070
to immortality for me
by the will of heaven.

459
00:20:56,070 --> 00:20:57,800
So you do remember you've spent

460
00:20:57,920 --> 00:20:59,640
all your life harnessing rivers.

461
00:20:59,640 --> 00:21:00,680
Let me ask you.

462
00:21:01,350 --> 00:21:03,550
You have built many waterways
in your life.

463
00:21:03,550 --> 00:21:04,550
Have you ever seen

464
00:21:04,550 --> 00:21:06,480
posts form naturally under water?

465
00:21:06,680 --> 00:21:09,610
Could naturally formed
stalagmites and stone steps

466
00:21:10,510 --> 00:21:12,590
be in such an orderly arrangement?

467
00:21:12,790 --> 00:21:13,590
You...

468
00:21:14,070 --> 00:21:15,000
I get it!

469
00:21:15,310 --> 00:21:17,480
You must be a demon
in disguise, intentionally

470
00:21:17,480 --> 00:21:18,750
obstructing my way to immortality!

471
00:21:18,750 --> 00:21:20,160
I might as well tell you the truth.

472
00:21:20,160 --> 00:21:21,920
On Taotie Terrace
where Huang Gang ascended,

473
00:21:21,920 --> 00:21:24,070
there are chains connecting to a ladder
hidden in the clouds.

474
00:21:24,070 --> 00:21:26,270
And inside Hu Hai's sword-forging furnace,

475
00:21:26,270 --> 00:21:28,510
there is a secret door
leading to the suburbs.

476
00:21:28,510 --> 00:21:29,270
They didn't

477
00:21:29,270 --> 00:21:30,590
go to the immortal realm at all,

478
00:21:30,590 --> 00:21:32,330
but were taken away by someone.

479
00:21:33,510 --> 00:21:34,320
Lord Jiang,

480
00:21:34,920 --> 00:21:36,790
take one more step forward,

481
00:21:37,550 --> 00:21:38,310
and you will

482
00:21:38,310 --> 00:21:39,880
end up the same as them.

483
00:21:40,000 --> 00:21:41,680
What proof do you have?

484
00:21:41,680 --> 00:21:42,680
Proof?

485
00:21:56,880 --> 00:21:57,790
Lord Jiang.

486
00:21:59,550 --> 00:22:02,350
The donkey that Huang Gang rode
on his way to ascension

487
00:22:02,350 --> 00:22:03,880
is still in the human world.

488
00:22:08,000 --> 00:22:08,830
Lord Jiang.

489
00:22:11,830 --> 00:22:13,430
Come back and save yourself.

490
00:22:38,830 --> 00:22:39,790
My Lord, there are indeed

491
00:22:39,790 --> 00:22:41,440
secret mechanisms
and a cave hidden in the water.

492
00:22:41,440 --> 00:22:44,770
It is utterly deep and leading
straight out of the mountain.

493
00:22:46,110 --> 00:22:48,350
Jiang Zeshui was captured by demon-men.

494
00:22:48,350 --> 00:22:50,240
I assume the same just happened

495
00:22:50,240 --> 00:22:51,550
to Huang Gang and Hu Hai.

496
00:22:51,550 --> 00:22:54,030
As expected, this case

497
00:22:54,550 --> 00:22:56,030
is truly related to Liluo.

498
00:23:04,030 --> 00:23:04,960
Anything wrong?

499
00:23:09,240 --> 00:23:11,440
Nothing. Just an old ailment acting up.

500
00:23:13,350 --> 00:23:14,160
This is the first time

501
00:23:14,160 --> 00:23:15,830
we've caught a living demon-man.

502
00:23:15,830 --> 00:23:16,680
Let's give him a good whipping

503
00:23:16,680 --> 00:23:18,050
when we're back to the bureau,

504
00:23:18,050 --> 00:23:19,160
and see if he'll spill anything.

505
00:23:19,160 --> 00:23:20,000
Let me ask you.

506
00:23:20,550 --> 00:23:22,480
Where were you in the past few days?

507
00:23:24,720 --> 00:23:26,030
Do I even need to report to you

508
00:23:26,030 --> 00:23:27,310
about where I've been?

509
00:23:27,790 --> 00:23:29,030
You're not the chief.

510
00:23:29,400 --> 00:23:30,720
If you had come back earlier,

511
00:23:30,720 --> 00:23:32,000
things would have been different

512
00:23:32,000 --> 00:23:33,790
and Jiang Zeshui
wouldn't have been captured.

513
00:23:33,790 --> 00:23:35,830
At least there are still living souls
in the Jiang household.

514
00:23:35,830 --> 00:23:36,890
However, I heard

515
00:23:36,960 --> 00:23:38,440
that none in the Huang household

516
00:23:38,440 --> 00:23:39,240
that you were looking into

517
00:23:39,240 --> 00:23:40,350
had survived.

518
00:23:40,920 --> 00:23:41,980
Oh right, Meng Rui.

519
00:23:42,240 --> 00:23:43,720
You're like the Grim Reaper.

520
00:23:43,720 --> 00:23:45,580
Wherever you go, many people die.

521
00:23:45,920 --> 00:23:47,290
I'm just kidding.

522
00:23:47,720 --> 00:23:49,980
Wipe that icy look off your face already.

523
00:24:02,550 --> 00:24:03,610
What's the matter?

524
00:24:03,920 --> 00:24:05,590
Did you smell something?

525
00:24:05,750 --> 00:24:07,110
Yes, a unique scent.

526
00:24:07,960 --> 00:24:09,440
I think I've smelled it somewhere before,

527
00:24:09,440 --> 00:24:10,500
but I can't name it.

528
00:24:12,720 --> 00:24:14,920
Besides being obsessed with cultivation,

529
00:24:14,920 --> 00:24:16,030
was there anything else unusual

530
00:24:16,030 --> 00:24:17,790
about Lord Jiang before the incident?

531
00:24:17,790 --> 00:24:19,830
If I have to name one thing, then I'd say

532
00:24:19,830 --> 00:24:22,640
the master constantly had nightmares
in the past few years.

533
00:24:22,640 --> 00:24:23,440
Yes.

534
00:24:23,720 --> 00:24:25,590
I also remember
the master having nightmares.

535
00:24:25,590 --> 00:24:26,720
On the night of the Mid-Autumn Festival,

536
00:24:26,720 --> 00:24:27,440
the whole family was waiting

537
00:24:27,440 --> 00:24:28,920
for the master to wake up from meditation

538
00:24:28,920 --> 00:24:30,240
so as to admire the moon together.

539
00:24:30,240 --> 00:24:31,040
That's right.

540
00:24:31,110 --> 00:24:31,920
All of a sudden,

541
00:24:31,920 --> 00:24:33,960
the master started yelling in his room

542
00:24:33,960 --> 00:24:35,400
and broke out in a cold sweat all over,

543
00:24:35,400 --> 00:24:37,730
muttering about things like retribution

544
00:24:37,790 --> 00:24:39,120
and karmic infliction.

545
00:24:39,400 --> 00:24:40,440
Did you just say

546
00:24:40,790 --> 00:24:42,520
this only began a few years ago?

547
00:24:42,720 --> 00:24:43,510
Yes.

548
00:24:43,790 --> 00:24:44,590
Yes.

549
00:24:47,030 --> 00:24:49,960
Then for him, death was better
than living.

550
00:24:50,440 --> 00:24:51,750
It didn't happen every day.

551
00:24:51,750 --> 00:24:54,210
The master's nightmares came at intervals.

552
00:24:54,640 --> 00:24:55,890
But I can't remember

553
00:24:56,030 --> 00:24:57,510
exactly how long.

554
00:25:13,240 --> 00:25:14,300
Little did I expect

555
00:25:14,640 --> 00:25:16,040
the Lanyue Pavilion case

556
00:25:16,340 --> 00:25:18,600
to be related to Liluo and the Dark Night.

557
00:25:32,510 --> 00:25:33,310
Zhenzhu.

558
00:25:33,960 --> 00:25:34,790
Previously,

559
00:25:34,790 --> 00:25:36,790
you examined the body
of Hu Hai's granddaughter.

560
00:25:36,790 --> 00:25:39,030
