578
00:26:14,400 --> 00:26:16,550
The disappearances
of these three officials,

579
00:26:16,550 --> 00:26:18,610
Huang Gang, Jiang Zeshui, and Hu Hai,

580
00:26:18,640 --> 00:26:20,300
