00:36:48,130 --> 00:36:49,050
[Brief Records of the Kingdom of Liluo
in the Third Year of Zhengwu Reign]

795
00:36:49,440 --> 00:36:51,030
In the third year of Zhengwu Reign,
namely 47 years ago,

796
00:36:51,030 --> 00:36:52,400
