married someone of the Tang household.

842
00:38:26,360 --> 00:38:27,150
Exactly.

843
00:38:27,590 --> 00:38:28,960
Kongyuzi's husband is

844
00:38:29,320 --> 00:38:31,920
Qin Dayuan, butler of the Tang household.

845
00:38:32,570 --> 00:38:34,230
Over all these years, Kongyuzi

846
00:38:34,230 --> 00:38:35,630
always lived in the countryside

847
00:38:35,630 --> 00:38:37,760
and rarely met with Qin Dayuan.

848
00:38:37,760 --> 00:38:40,490
She didn't enter Tianhuang City
until recently.

849
00:38:48,440 --> 00:38:51,500
Those people dumped Mrs. Qin's body
in the wilderness.

850
00:38:52,440 --> 00:38:54,500
What exactly are they trying to hide?

851
00:38:54,590 --> 00:38:56,230
Master, Master Sun,

852
00:38:56,550 --> 00:38:57,840
word from the Tang residence says

853
00:38:57,840 --> 00:38:59,570
that Qin Dayuan is now missing.

854
00:38:59,710 --> 00:39:01,760
Since he went to Lanyue Pavilion

855
00:39:01,760 --> 00:39:03,760
to mourn Young Master Tang three days ago,

856
00:39:03,760 --> 00:39:04,920
he hasn't returned home.

857
00:39:04,920 --> 00:39:06,000
Their butler is missing.

858
00:39:06,000 --> 00:39:07,800
The Tang household must've realized it.

859
00:39:07,800 --> 00:39:09,440
What took them so long to report it?

860
00:39:09,440 --> 00:39:10,840
Before Qin Dayuan left,

861
00:39:11,360 --> 00:39:13,230
did he say anything about it?

862
00:39:13,400 --> 00:39:14,960
How did you know, Master?

863
00:39:14,960 --> 00:39:17,230
I sent someone to investigate
at the Tang residence.

864
00:39:17,230 --> 00:39:19,000
Qin Dayuan did say

865
00:39:19,320 --> 00:39:21,030
that if he didn't return in three days,

866
00:39:21,030 --> 00:39:22,440
his missing should be reported

867
00:39:22,440 --> 00:39:23,630
to the Divine Constable Bureau

868
00:39:23,630 --> 00:39:24,800
at noon the next day.

869
00:39:26,710 --> 00:39:28,320
There is indeed a plot.

870
00:39:28,840 --> 00:39:30,170
There's one more thing.

871
00:39:30,400 --> 00:39:31,320
These days,

872
00:39:31,510 --> 00:39:33,510
in the dead of night, howling sounds

873
00:39:33,630 --> 00:39:35,320
would come from Lanyue Pavilion.

874
00:39:35,320 --> 00:39:36,580
It's very terrifying.

875
00:39:36,960 --> 00:39:38,000
People say

876
00:39:38,590 --> 00:39:41,800
that it's because Mr. Tang Wei's spirit
is still

877
00:39:42,030 --> 00:39:42,840
lingering.

878
00:39:45,030 --> 00:39:45,840
Impossible.

879
00:39:48,360 --> 00:39:49,150
That said,

880
00:39:51,150 --> 00:39:52,350
logically speaking,

881
00:39:52,630 --> 00:39:54,190
after Mr. Tang's passing,

882
00:39:55,030 --> 00:39:55,800
there should be

883
00:39:55,800 --> 00:39:57,360
no one in Lanyue Pavilion.

884
00:39:58,590 --> 00:39:59,790
Where do these sounds

885
00:40:01,510 --> 00:40:03,000
come from?

886
00:40:05,570 --> 00:40:08,190
[If lord and vassal are in harmony,
why not?]

887
00:40:07,400 --> 00:40:08,840
Since Qin Dayuan came

888
00:40:08,840 --> 00:40:10,900
to Lanyue Pavilion to mourn Tang Wei,

889
00:40:11,360 --> 00:40:12,320
then he must've gone missing

890
00:40:12,320 --> 00:40:15,580
on the seventh floor,
where Tang Wei's incident happened.

891
00:40:17,540 --> 00:40:19,100
[Lanyue Pavilion]

892
00:40:49,840 --> 00:40:51,470
[Tang Mansion]

893
00:40:54,660 --> 00:40:56,860
[Tang Mansion]

894
00:41:56,430 --> 00:42:00,110
[Second Floor]

895
00:42:11,960 --> 00:42:14,000
[Third Floor]

896
00:42:30,000 --> 00:42:31,260
Lady Constable Frost!

897
00:42:34,190 --> 00:42:34,920
My Lady,

898
00:42:34,920 --> 00:42:36,760
we've searched Qin Dayuan's room.

899
00:42:36,760 --> 00:42:37,960
No clues can be found.

900
00:42:38,840 --> 00:42:40,240
Where is Tang Wei's room?

901
00:42:40,510 --> 00:42:41,320
My Lady,

902
00:42:41,590 --> 00:42:43,030
that is Tang Wei's room.

903
00:42:44,280 --> 00:42:45,070
Besides...

904
00:42:45,710 --> 00:42:47,640
Before Mr. Tang's missing, he said

905
00:42:47,710 --> 00:42:48,630
that after he died,

906
00:42:48,630 --> 00:42:49,440
no one,

907
00:42:49,440 --> 00:42:50,920
not even Qin Dayuan,

908
00:42:50,920 --> 00:42:51,590
should enter

909
00:42:51,590 --> 00:42:52,760
his room to clean it.

910
00:42:52,960 --> 00:42:54,110
He also said that all were banned

911
00:42:54,110 --> 00:42:55,550
from entering his room except that

912
00:42:55,550 --> 00:42:56,000
when

913
00:42:56,000 --> 00:42:58,400
the Divine Constable Bureau
made arrests.

914
00:43:13,840 --> 00:43:14,970
Watch out for traps.

915
00:43:16,000 --> 00:43:17,840
I meant to investigate the Tang residence.

916
00:43:17,840 --> 00:43:19,000
Upon hearing about Qin Dayuan's missing,

917
00:43:19,000 --> 00:43:20,260
I came to meet with you.

918
00:43:20,440 --> 00:43:21,440
Any discoveries?

919
00:43:21,440 --> 00:43:22,230
So far, no.

920
00:44:20,590 --> 00:44:21,440
Qin Dayuan,

921
00:44:23,440 --> 00:44:25,360
I know you can hear me.

922
00:44:26,840 --> 00:44:29,040
Didn't you set up these seven fish tanks

923
00:44:29,150 --> 00:44:29,920
just to

924
00:44:29,920 --> 00:44:31,360
let me see through the mechanism

925
00:44:31,360 --> 00:44:32,960
and lure me here, didn't you?

926
00:44:33,960 --> 00:44:35,000
In that case,

927
00:44:35,440 --> 00:44:37,400
why are you hiding?
